# MindWell AI - Environment Variables
# Both keys are optional: If omitted, the app will use its built-in smart clinical reasoning engine!

# 1. Google Gemini API Key (Recommended, free tier available at https://aistudio.google.com/)
GEMINI_API_KEY=your_gemini_api_key_here

# 2. OpenAI API Key (Optional alternative)
OPENAI_API_KEY=your_openai_api_key_here
